Description:
    Installs the wizard_step_states table that backs BusinessLogic::Wizard
    (the DB-backed, verify-only step runner) and BusinessLogic::WizardStepState.
    Run once per host app.

Example:
    bin/rails generate business_logic:wizard_install

    This creates the migration:
        db/migrate/<timestamp>_create_wizard_step_states.rb

    Then migrate, and subclass BusinessLogic::Wizard per flow:
        class OrganizationSetup < BusinessLogic::Wizard
          step(:identity) { ... }
        end
